    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "pandas.Index.insert# Index.insert(loc, item)[source]# Make new Index inserting new item at location. Follows Python numpy.insert semantics for negative values. Parameters: locint itemobject Returns: Index Examples >>> idx = pd.Index(['a', 'b', 'c']) >>> idx.insert(1, 'x') Index(['a', 'x', 'b', 'c'], dtype='object')",
